url: "https://kubersharma.com/frameworks"
abstract: >-
  Four practitioner frameworks for enterprise AI go-to-market, developed in
  product marketing functions at Microsoft, Salesforce, Tableau, and UiPath.
  The Augmented Marketing Decision Architecture (AMDA) allocates marketing
  decisions between AI and humans by stakes. The Pilot Trap models why
  enterprise AI stalls before production. The Trust Architecture models the
  three layers of enterprise buyer trust. The Belief Bridge closes the gap
  between what a product does and what a buyer believes it will do for them.
